		(uuid "9ab78d80-2d91-4fba-9dba-40337b8b3fda")
	)
	(text "Function: J3 receives barrel-jack 12 V. C2 stores input charge and C1 bypasses the XEM 12 V entry. D1 shunts transients; R1/D2\nindicate input voltage. TP1 and TP7 provide 12 V/GND probe access.\n\nSource / changes: Inherited carrier input structure; original circuit author/reference not established. The input block is not a\nTI protection reference design. V6 retains electrical values/connections and changes PCB placement/copper.\nPart references: Same Sky PJ-102AH; Panasonic EEE-FTE221XAP (C2, 220 uF/25 V); Diodes SMBJ15CA-13-F (D1).\nhttps://www.sameskydevices.com/product/resource/pj-102ah.pdf\nhttps://industrial.panasonic.com/cdbs/www-data/pdf/RDE0000/ABA0000C1242.pdf\nhttps://www.diodes.com/part/view/SMBJ15CA\nD1 maximum rated clamp is 24.4 V; U1 VIN absolute maximum is 20 V (TI SLVSAS0, February 2011, p. 2). Transient protection,\nreverse-input behavior, supply and load limits remain unqualified.\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps54429e.pdf\nCodex test pads follow the VIN/GND probe-point precedent in TI SLVU444A, Rev. A, August 2021, p. 6, Table 4-1. Local 1.5 mm\nKiCad-derived pads have no paste; fitted-stack probe/assembly access remains unverified.\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ug/slvu444a/slvu444a.pdf"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 140.97 234.95 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "a06d54a6-4b70-44db-8173-de6f9eea00e1")
	)
	(text "Function: D4 shows raw USB5V; R15=6.8k\nlimits its load to approximately0.5mA.\nTP5=rawUSB5V; TP6=FTDI3.3V; TP8=GND.\nSource / changes: Codex probe/LED branches.\nKingbright AA1608LSYSK,DSAQ3029,\nV2B,1Mar2025,p1pads/polarity,p2-p3:\nhttps://www.kingbrightusa.com/images/catalog/SPEC/AA1608LSYSK.pdf\nR15: Vishay doc20035,0603,1%,0.1W:\nhttps://www.vishay.com/docs/20035/dcrcwe3.pdf\nTP: TI SLVU444A,RevA,p6,Table4-1.\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ug/slvu444a/slvu444a.pdf\nUSB LED remains a VBUS load in suspend.\nBrightness/full USB current budget unverified.\nExisting D2/R1+12V indicator retained."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 403.225 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8e274ac-bac6-4aa6-80f2-f966837b3ab2")
	)
	(text "Connectors + Xem 1.8v\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
