	)
	(text "Function: H1-H4 align carrier mounting holes to XEM8305.\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly XEM8305-AXX Mechanical Drawing,\nPCB Revision AXX,sheet1, and XEM8305 Mating Board Diagram,\nsheet1; dimensionsmm.\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8305/specifications/\nCodex registration Xcarrier=101+Ymodule,Ycarrier=26+Xmodule.\nCenters: (105,35),(150,35),(105,105),(150,105); NPTH3.2mm.\n7mm hardware courtyard and track/via/pour keepout are provisional\nCodex choices. Actual head/washer OD and standoff height\nmust match the assembled connector stack. To clear mounting,\nJ3,C2,D1 and C35 placements shift; circuit nets unchanged."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 501.015 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.95 0.95)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "eaf88fd7-084e-4f35-9dc5-8190685ac757")
	)
	(text "Function: U4 translates TCK from FTDI3.3V to XEM1.8V.\nSource / changes: Opal Kelly BRK8305 A03,25Oct2023,\nJTAG sheet8/PDFp4: U500/C503/C504 -> U4/C34/C35.\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/downloads/583/download?category_id=3\nSame SN74AXC1T45DBVR and two100nF values; topology unchanged.\nCodex redraw follows BRK row spacing and vertical bypass layout.\nRail names: USBJTAG_3.3V / XEM_1.8V; DGND renamed GND.\nTI SCES882E,Dec2023,pp3,18:\nhttps://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/sn74axc1t45.pdf\nDIR5=3.3V (A-to-B). PCB/powered operation remain unverified."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 433.705 431.8 0)
		(effects
