	(text "Function: TP4 probes the module-sourced1.8V translator supply.\nSource / changes: Codex adds one passive pad at C35 rail.\nOpal Kelly XEM8305 Expansion Connectors /1.8V Power Supply:\nhttps://docs.opalkelly.com/xem8305/expansion-connectors/\nNo LED/load added to this rail or FTDI internal1.8V nodes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
