		(uuid "5936f439-e9c8-5bea-a45a-858440a1a09c")
	)
	(text "Function: MC1 links XEM8305 Bank64 to LDO J1.\nCLK32MHZ: J1.36 -> MC1.67 -> AD21 (positive GC).\nSPI_CLK: J1.22 <- MC1.49 <- AB20 (FPGA output).\nBank64 uses 1.5 V. Other 21 signal assignments unchanged.\n\nSource / changes: Codex clock-pin swap, 25 October 2026.\nInherited carrier structure; only MC1.49 / MC1.67 labels exchanged.\nJ1 contacts, library pin definitions and support circuits unchanged.\nOpal Kelly XEM8305 Pin List, MC1.49 / 67; accessed 25 Oct 2026:\nhttps://pins.opalkelly.com/pin_list/XEM8305\nMC1.67 = IO_L11P_T1U_N8_GC_64.\nMC1.49 = IO_L21N_T3L_N5_AD8N_64.\nAMD UltraScale Architecture Clocking Resources, UG572, v1.11,\n29 May 2025, Global Clock Inputs: single-ended external clock on P-side GC.\nhttps://docs.amd.com/r/en-US/ug572-ultrascale-clocking/Global-Clock-Inputs\nFirmware / XDC must match this map; implementation / timing unverified."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 156.21 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "6d805c4c-6165-544a-a93c-4e455cdc5365")
	)
)
